OL,3,AThieves steal 30,000 bottles of wine
OL,4,Aworth bB,5m in Italy, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThieves have stolen 30,000 bottles of
OL,7,Fwine collectively worth about bB,5m
OL,8,F(#4.2m) from a prestigious Italian
OL,9,Fwinery, Italian media report.
OL,11,FMarchesi Antinori, one of Italy's
OL,12,Fbiggest family-owned wineries, said the
OL,13,Ftheft at its storage facility in
OL,14,FTuscany took place on Saturday as the
OL,15,Fcompany was preparing to ship a
OL,16,Fconsignment to customers abroad.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
