OL,3,AThieves steal 30,000 bottles of wine
OL,4,Aworth bB,5m in Italy, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least seven masked men are believed
OL,7,Fto have deactivated the alarms,
OL,8,Fdisabled the cameras and used company
OL,9,Fforklifts to load two large trucks of
OL,10,Fthe company's prized Tignanello, Solaia
OL,11,Fand Guado al Tasso Tuscan reds.
OL,13,FRenzo Cotarella, the chief executive,
OL,14,Ftold Italian newspaper Corriere della
OL,15,FSera this was the largest theft of its
OL,16,Fkind in Italy.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
